-- smucclaw/l4-ide#1074 (F1, ruled by Meng 2026-11-22: Clause Layout Rulings F1 A): a
-- second LEST on a nested rule's first line is that rule's, and is refused naming it.

DECLARE Person IS ONE OF Seller, Buyer
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF delivery, payment

c MEANS
  PARTY Seller
  MUST delivery
  HENCE PARTY Buyer MUST payment LEST BREACH BY Buyer LEST BREACH BY Seller
